  m_text: 'Use keys to choose which biome the next room will be. Break objects to
    discover keys.


    Every room contains its own enemies, drops, and upgrades.


    Upgrade
    books grant +(layer amount) to each stat. Place your biomes strategically to
    maximize gains.


    There''s a stat cap limiting your strength, but dungeon
    layers are infinite.'
