  m_text: 'The dungeon is structured as a square grid.Each room occupies one square
    on the grid.


    Rooms form layers based on their distance from the starting
    point.


    Greater depth means more enemies, harder battles, and superior powerups.


    Your
    current layer is displayed in the top left.'
